<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" dir="ltr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Password Successfully Changed</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      background-color: #f8fafc;
      color: #0f172a;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background-color: #ffffff;
    }
    .header {
      background-color: #1e40af;
      padding: 30px 20px;
      text-align: left;
    }
    .header h1 {
      margin: 0;
      color: #ffffff;
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .content {
      padding: 40px 20px;
    }
    .content h2 {
      color: #1e40af;
      font-size: 20px;
      margin: 0 0 20px 0;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .content p {
      margin: 0 0 16px 0;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #0f172a;
    }
    .info-card {
      background-color: #f8fafc;
      border-left: 4px solid #16a34a;
      padding: 20px;
      margin: 20px 0;
      border-radius: 4px;
    }
    .info-card p {
      margin: 8px 0;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    .info-card strong {
      color: #1e40af;
    }
    .security-notice {
      background-color: #fef3c7;
      border-left: 4px solid #eab308;
      padding: 16px;
      margin: 20px 0;
      border-radius: 4px;
    }
    .security-notice p {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #854d0e;
    }
    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 12px 24px;
      margin: 20px 0;
      background-color: #1e40af;
      color: #ffffff !important;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .button:hover {
      background-color: #1e3a8a;
    }
    .footer {
      background-color: #f8fafc;
      padding: 20px;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #64748b;
    }
    .footer p {
      margin: 8px 0;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="header">
      <h1>Equipment Rental Platform</h1>
    </div>

    <!-- Content -->
    <div class="content">
      <h2>Password Successfully Changed</h2>
      
      <p>Dear {{fullName}},</p>
      
      <p>Your password has been successfully changed. You can now use your new password to log in to the Equipment Rental Platform.</p>

      <div class="info-card">
        <p><strong>Password Changed:</strong> {{passwordChangedAt}}</p>
        <p><strong>IP Address:</strong> {{ipAddress}}</p>
        <p><strong>Device:</strong> {{userAgent}}</p>
      </div>

      <div class="security-notice">
        <p><strong>⚠️ Security Notice:</strong> If you did not make this change, please contact your administrator immediately.</p>
      </div>

      <p>You can now log in with your new password:</p>

      <a href="{{loginUrl}}" class="button">Go to Login</a>

      <p>Welcome aboard! If you have any questions or need assistance, please contact your company administrator.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <div class="footer">
      <p>&copy; {{currentYear}} Equipment Rental Platform. All rights reserved.</p>
      <p>This is an automated message. Please do not reply to this email.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
